  "problem": "What is the minor of ${e}_{32}$ in the matrix\n$E=[\\begin{aligned}2p & p & -q \\\\ -p & {q}^{2} & 3q \\\\ q & 0 & q\\end{aligned}]?$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we remove the third row and the second column:\n\n$$\nE=[\\begin{aligned}2p & \u2217 & -q \\\\ -p & \u2217 & 3q \\\\ \u2217 & 0 & \u2217\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNext, we calculate the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det[\\begin{aligned}2p & -q \\\\ -p & 3q\\end{aligned}] & =|\\begin{aligned}2p & -q \\\\ -p & 3q\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2p\\cdot 3q-(-q)\\cdot (-p) \\\\  & =6pq-pq \\\\  & =5pq\\end{aligned}\n$$",
